ADDITIONAL NOTICE — SATIRE DISCLAIMER

This project is a work of parody and satire. All content within it —
including but not limited to organisations, officials, documents, statistics,
speeches, hotline numbers, and public notices — is entirely fictional and
intentionally absurd. It does not represent, endorse, or attack any real
country, government, political party, organisation, or individual.

The satire targets bureaucratic formalism in general: forms, procedures,
hotlines, satisfaction surveys, systems that are permanently under
maintenance, and notices that merely forward other notices.

Any resemblance to real persons, living or dead, or to real institutions, is
coincidental and unintended.
